    photo: {fileID: 130705454}
  - version: v4.0
    title: "Primeiro GraphExplorer: grafo de n\xF3s com seta"
    detail: "Mapa Nodes. Explora n\xF3s colocados \xE0 m\xE3o, guiado pela seta (dica
      de para onde ir). C\xF3digo de 08/09.\nGraphExplorerV1.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 494051061}
    agent: {fileID: 494051062}
    target: {fileID: 0}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 474, y: 2.76, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 42, y: 2.9400003, z: 49}
    photo: {fileID: 1675620291}
  - version: v4.3.1
    title: Sem seta, do zero, no Node_4
    detail: "Primeiro run v\xE1lido no Node_4: nunca passou da 1\xAA li\xE7\xE3o,
      cobertura ~13%. C\xF3digo de 27/09.\nGraphExplorer_node4_noarrow_9M.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 892054256}
    agent: {fileID: 892054258}
    target: {fileID: 892054257}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 624, y: 2.682156, z: 0.000015258789}
      m_Extent: {x: 48, y: 3.0178504, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 1149492894}
  - version: v4.3.6 E2
    title: 'Em etapas: explorar tirando a seta'
    detail: "Movimento livre (andar e olhar separados); a seta vai sumindo. Parou
      em ~42% de cobertura. C\xF3digo de 28/09.\nGraphExplorer_node4_e2_04_187k.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 1297590140}
    agent: {fileID: 1297590142}
    target: {fileID: 1297590141}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 780, y: 2.6821537, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 48, y: 3.017848, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 97066577}
  - version: v4.3.6 E3
    title: 'Em etapas: achar o hider parado'
    detail: "Nasce o mapa de suspeita (onde a presa pode estar). Pega o hider em
      ~56% dos epis\xF3dios. C\xF3digo de 28/09.\nGraphExplorer_node4_e3_01_748k.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 1147063833}
    agent: {fileID: 1147063835}
    target: {fileID: 1147063834}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 936, y: 2.6821537, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 48, y: 3.017848, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 1889704556}
  - version: v5.0
    title: Salas e portas, sem seta
    detail: "Mapa Node_5: toda sala vale igual, porta perde valor ao repetir. ~70%
      das salas, pega ~2/3. C\xF3digo de 02/10.\nGraphExplorer_v4.0.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 2099952494}
    agent: {fileID: 2099952496}
    target: {fileID: 2099952495}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 1103, y: 2.6821537, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 59, y: 3.017848, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 2125146655}
  - version: v5.1
    title: Planta de salas
    detail: "Sensor com as 26 salas; ver a sala conta como explorar. 76\u201383%
      das salas, pega 83%. C\xF3digo de 03/10.\nGraphExplorer_v4.1.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 1929474239}
    agent: {fileID: 1929474241}
    target: {fileID: 1929474240}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 1281, y: 2.6821537, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 59, y: 3.017848, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 1956033453}
  - version: v5.1.2
    title: "Ca\xE7a herdando a v5.1"
    detail: "Presa sem pausa que foge a 18 m, de 4 a 8 m/s. V\xEA ~89%, pega ~72%.
      C\xF3digo de 03/10.\nGraphExplorer_v4.3.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 1749821834}
    agent: {fileID: 1749821836}
    target: {fileID: 1749821835}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 1459, y: 2.6821537, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 59, y: 3.017848, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 176159805}
  - version: v5.3
    title: "Salas e portas sobre o grafo de n\xF3s"
    detail: "Mapa Node_5 (26 salas). Sem seta: explora por salas, mapa de suspeita
      e ca\xE7a. 50M do zero.\nGraphExplorer_05_50M.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 154541944}
    agent: {fileID: 154541946}
    target: {fileID: 154541945}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 1637, y: 0.8137188, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 59, y: 3.0178504, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 339957902}
  - version: v6.0
    title: "Grafo de n\xF3s + NavMesh na persegui\xE7\xE3o"
    detail: "Ca\xE7a herdando a v5.3: rota NavMesh s\xF3 vendo o alvo, rastro de
      3 s, pressa. 8M.\nGraphExplorer_v5.2.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 828893252}
    agent: {fileID: 828893254}
    target: {fileID: 828893253}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 1815, y: 2.682156, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 59, y: 3.0178504, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 330510480}
  - version: v7.0
    title: Explorador livre, do zero
    detail: "Sem n\xF3s: pontos de vis\xE3o gerados pelo NavMesh que ele precisa
      VER e portas achadas sozinhas. 9.5M.\nMapa Node_5; no treino a presa ainda
      andava de n\xF3 em n\xF3. FreeExplorer_v8.0_9.5M.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 12804798}
    agent: {fileID: 12804799}
    target: {fileID: 12804797}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 1993, y: 2.682156, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 59, y: 3.0178504, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 626747782}
  - version: v7.1
    title: "Livre, curr\xEDculo completo com chaves"
    detail: "Escrit\xF3rio mobiliado; presa que foge, se esconde e leva chaves para
      escapar. 35M do zero.\nFreeExplorer_v8.1M_35M.onnx"
    arena: {fileID: 92048630}
    agent: {fileID: 92048631}
    target: {fileID: 92048629}
    bounds:
      m_Center: {x: 2171, y: 0.8137188, z: 0}
      m_Extent: {x: 59, y: 3.0178504, z: 51.98751}
    photo: {fileID: 96693295}
  - version: v7.2
    title: "O c\xE9rebro da v7.1 no Map - V8"
    detail: "N\xFAmeros do jogo (vis\xE3o 80\xB0/30 m, persegui\xE7\xE3o 9 m/s);
